Implement real dynamic visitor review system and fix admin settings

- Replaced hardcoded static testimonials with 100% dynamic review system fetching real reviews from SQLite database
- Added visitor "Write a Review" modal on public site to collect real ratings & reviews from visitors
- Added Client Reviews management tab in admin dashboard to view and delete reviews
- Made admin profile Name & Email fields fully editable with PUT /api/auth/profile backend update
- Fixed admin dark/light mode toggle to reliably switch interface themes
